    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just one mistake. it's who i am. like i look in the mirror and i just see someone who doesn't deserve to be here. people think you can just \"move on\" or \"learn from it,\" but how do you move on when you know you're just a net negative to the world? like everything i touch just ends up ruined. it feels like the only honest thing left to do is just... stop being a problem for everyone.",
